  <front>
    <title>DHCPv6 Option for IPv4-Embedded Multicast and Unicast IPv6 Prefixes</title>
    <seriesInfo name="RFC" value="8115" stream="IETF"/>
    <date year="2017" month="March"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document defines a Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol version 6
(DHCPv6) Option for multicast IPv4 service continuity solutions,
which is used to carry the IPv6 prefixes to be used to build unicast
and multicast IPv4-embedded IPv6 addresses.</t>
    </abstract>
